a twist in it and loop the two end together with tape. 

Whala a Mobius strip.  A two dimensional object with only 1 side.

A Klein bottle, can be made by taking a pepsi bottle (coke if you prefer)
streach the neck bend it towards the body and puch a hole in the side
where the lips of the bottle meet the body.  Merge the lips onto the hole
and seal around the neck.  Keep pulling the bootle neck through the hole
to the base of the bottle.  Cut the bottom of the bottle of and open the
lips of the neck up to match where the bottom used to be.  Seal them together

Whala, A klein bottle.  A two dimensional object with only no definable
inside or out.

